+Wasmer detects the Gatsby site, runs `npm install` and `npm run build`, and serves the generated `public` folder as static files. The button imports and builds this public repository as-is; it does not fork it. To customize the site and redeploy on every push, fork this starter and import your own repository on Wasmer.
